sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent wallet
  participant API as API
  participant Q as Queue
  participant W as Restricted grader worker
  participant E as ChallengeEscrow
  participant IDX as Indexer
  A->>API: request wallet nonce; sign nonce-bound submission
  API->>API: recover wallet, replay-check nonce, validate/hash/limit/deadline, persist
  API->>Q: enqueue grading job
  Q->>W: challenge-specific source + solution
  W-->>API: authenticated job-bound normalized result only
  API->>E: backend signs EIP-712 then broadcasts finalize
  E-->>IDX: SubmissionFinalized
  IDX->>API: confirmed final settlement projection and payout state
